OCR models (downloaded on demand, not bundled)
----------------------------------------------

Kimochi does not include any OCR model. When you choose MeikiOCR or Manga OCR,
the app downloads that engine's model files from their upstream location.
Every file is pinned by revision, SHA-256 and size in src-tauri/ocr-models.json.

MeikiOCR models, LGPL-3.0, by rtr46 on Hugging Face:
  - https://huggingface.co/rtr46/meiki.text.detect.v0
