OneOCR (Windows, optional)
--------------------------

Kimochi does not include or redistribute anything from Microsoft for OneOCR.
The OneOCR engine uses oneocr.dll, oneocr.onemodel and onnxruntime.dll that
you supply yourself from your own copy of Windows Snipping Tool (Settings
explains how when you choose OneOCR); your use of those files is governed by Microsoft's terms for
that software. Kimochi ships only its own GPL-3.0-only helper process
(oneocr-worker/), which loads them.


